  "releaseNotes": "NEW: Upgrade support for Google.Cloud.PubSub.V1 to version 3.18.0\nNEW: Upgrade support for ServiceStack.Redis to version 8.4.0\nNEW: Upgrade support for Npgsql.EntityFrameworkCore.PostgreSQL to version 9.0.2\nNEW: Upgrade support for ServiceStack.Redis to version 8.5.2\nNEW: Upgrade support for MongoDB.Driver to version 3.1.0\nNEW: Upgrade support for MongoDB.Driver to version 3.1.0\nNEW: Upgrade support for Microsoft.Azure.Cosmos to version 3.45.0\nIMPROVEMENT: Expand WCF span with HTTP Status Code\nFIX: Confluent Kafka : Fixing continuation of traces after Consume operation in Kafka.\nNEW: Upgrade support for log4net to version 3.0.0\nNEW: Upgrade support for RabbitMQ.Client to version 7.0.0",
